{"title":"2025 SSMO Relay Round 1 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d859e4443415bc115f926374648de5f694305d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = TNYWR.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" /> Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3f4f650f18eb987e5ee08476a4f037ca4108d44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2-n^2 = T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />. What is the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005